    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Maryline a grandi dans un petit village. Ses parents ne recevaient jamais personne et vivaient les volets clos. \u00c0 20 ans, elle \u00ab monte \u00e0 Paris \u00bb pour devenir com\u00e9dienne. Mais, elle n\u2019a pas les mots pour se d\u00e9fendre. Elle est confront\u00e9e \u00e0 tout ce que ce m\u00e9tier et le monde peuvent avoir d\u2019humiliant mais aussi de bienveillant. C\u2019est l\u2019histoire d\u2019une femme, d\u2019une femme modeste, d\u2019une blessure.",
        "english": "Maryline grew up in a small village. Her parents never welcomed any guests and lived behind closed shutters. When Maryline turns twenty, she \"goes up to Paris\" to become an actress. But she doesn't know how to express and defend herself. She is confronted by everything humiliating and beneficial that this job and the world have to offer. It's the story of a woman, of a modest woman, of a wound."
